// Potential In-Memory Execution Using Reflection.Assembly | T1620 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/powershell/powershell_script/posh_ps_dotnet_assembly_from_file.yml
powershell.file.script_block_text:*\[Reflection.Assembly\]\:\:load* AND (NOT ((winlog.event_data.Path:(C\:\\Program\ Files\ \(x86\)\\Microsoft\ SQL\ Server\\* OR C\:\\Program\ Files\\Microsoft\ SQL\ Server\\*)) AND winlog.event_data.Path:*\\Tools\\PowerShell\\Modules\\SQLPS\\SqlPsPostScript.ps1 AND powershell.file.script_block_text:*SQLSERVER\:\ \{\ Set\-Location*))
